#: kio_smb.cpp:2274 kio_smb.cpp:2325 kio_smb.cpp:2339 kio_smb.cpp:2358
msgid ""
"\n"
"Make sure that the samba package is installed properly on your system."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pastikan pakej samba dipasang dengan betul pada sistem anda."

#: kio_smb.cpp:353
msgid ""
"\n"
"There is probably no SMB service running on this host."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Mungkin tiada servis SMB berfungsi pada hos ini."

#: kio_smb.cpp:376 kio_smb.cpp:382
msgid ""
"\n"
"Invalid user/password combination."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kombinasi pengguna/kata laluan yang tidak sah."

#: kio_smb.cpp:415
msgid "Unable to parse response message."
msgstr "Gagal menghuraikan mesej balas."

#: kio_smb.cpp:568
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Pelayan"

#: kio_smb.cpp:571
msgid "Workgroup"
msgstr "Kumpulan Kerja"

#: kio_smb.cpp:576
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Kongsi"

#: kio_smb.cpp:765
msgid ""
"To access the shares of a host, use smb://hostname\n"
"To get a list of all hosts use lan:/ or rlan:/ .\n"
"See the KDE Control Center under Network, LANBrowsing for more information."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mencapai perkongsian pada hos, guna smb://hostname\n"
"Untuk dapatkan senarai semua hos guna lan:/ or rlan:/ .\n"
"Lihat Pusat Kawalan KDE di dalam Jaringan, LANBrowsing untuk maklumat lanjut."

#: kio_smb.cpp:1256
msgid ""
"\n"
"To access the shares of a host, use smb://hostname\n"
"To get a list of all hosts use lan:/ or rlan:/ .\n"
"See the KDE Control Center under Network, LANBrowsing for more information."
msgstr ""
"\n"
